</div>
<!-- FAQ 2: COLLAPSED -->
<div class="faq-item bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full px-space-lg py-space-lg text-left flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-label-md text-label-md font-bold shrink-0">02</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Are my donations 100% tax-deductible?</span>
</div>
<div class="faq-icon-wrapper w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
</div>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-space-xs">
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Yes. Give-AID is a registered 501(c)(3) public charity in the United States and works alongside authorized non-profit entities in Canada, the UK, the European Union, and Australia. All donations receive an instantaneous official PDF tax receipt compliant with IRS Section 170 regulations. Receipts are archived permanently inside your personal Donor Dashboard.
              </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FAQ 3: COLLAPSED -->
<div class="faq-item bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full px-space-lg py-space-lg text-left flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-label-md text-label-md font-bold shrink-0">03</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">How can I double my contribution through Corporate Matching?</span>
</div>
<div class="faq-icon-wrapper w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
</div>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-space-xs">
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Over 26,000 global employers match gifts made through Give-AID. Simply enter your company's name at donation checkout or in your receipt email. Our automated matching tool pre-populates your employer's electronic verification claim so funds are credited directly to your supported cause within 30 days.
              </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FAQ 4: COLLAPSED -->
<div class="faq-item bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full px-space-lg py-space-lg text-left flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-label-md text-label-md font-bold shrink-0">04</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Can I volunteer for programmes without prior non-profit experience?</span>
</div>
<div class="faq-icon-wrapper w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
</div>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-space-xs">
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Absolutely. Most community nutrition, tutoring, logistics, and disaster supply packing initiatives welcome first-time volunteers. Specialized medical and technical deployments require verified accreditation, but we offer free preparatory onboarding modules for all grassroots volunteers.
              </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FAQ 5: COLLAPSED -->
<div class="faq-item bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full px-space-lg py-space-lg text-left flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-label-md text-label-md font-bold shrink-0">05</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">What percentage of my contribution goes directly to beneficiaries?</span>
</div>
<div class="faq-icon-wrapper w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
</div>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-space-xs">
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                A minimum of 94.2% of every pledged dollar is transferred straight to the verified field programme. Platform maintenance and banking transaction fees account for 5.8%, supported substantially by our corporate endowments so that community impact remains maximized.
              </p>
</div>
